Tier 7 -- simulated cluster life, seeded (reaper guest, shape A).

A generator dealing weighted events from a fixed seed against a shadow model of
expected placement and lineage, with five invariants diffed continuously. The
oracle self-test is written before the generator: invariants fed hand-built
broken states must each complain, and that runs at tier-4 cost with no cluster
at all. See TESTING.md §7.

Empty at M0.

Files named t_*.sh are tests; anything else here is ignored.
